					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "GRID PATTERN\nThe Grid Pattern node generates a collection of Float2 values that results in a grid pattern. Alternatively the type can be set to Box2D to produce a grid of UV values.\n\nThe rows and columns parameters determine the final size of the collection (rows x columns).\nThe size parameter sets the width and height disttance between points.\n\nNote that the rows and columns require a cord at attribute flow."
					}
				},
