						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 4: GRID CLONER\n\nIn this example we're making a simple grid cloner by using the Grid Pattern on some meshes.\nFirst we create Rectangle geometry to project our texture on.\nNext we apply the Grid Pattern through a Transformation2D node to place the geometry in a grid pattern.\nFinally we project our test card from the Texture In onto the geometry by using th Texture Material node."
